{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33235","headline":"观山灯献徐尚书 三 · 温庭皓","name":"观山灯献徐尚书 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春山收暝色，爝火集余辉。\n丽景饶红焰，祥光出翠微。\n白榆行自比，青桂影相依。\n唯有偷光客，追游欲忘归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭皓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33235.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33235","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}